      "id": "M4163-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A. 对以下明确给定的虚构算术与当前词库记录做有界审查。E(z)=-log(sum exp(z_c))，T=1，拒绝条件E>t，t=-1.8。已知样本A的logits=[2,1]，未知样本B=[1,0]。先算能量、softmax和拒绝决策。若给所有样本的全部类别logits统一加3，同时将阈值改为t-3，是否改变类别概率、排名和拒绝决策？如果只给B的全部类别logits加5，而A不变，概率和能量排名是否仍同时不变？不要把这类合成恒等式当真实模型表现，不因能量数值变化就要求一次不必要的科研重跑，也不要认为输入相关的偏置总能由一个全局阈值修复。然后查当前包中free energy/自由能的中译证据具体已到哪层：词形、分类打分语境、两篇英文运算定义、中文独立公式和正式审定标准不可混为一谈。只如实报告实际包内现有记录；官方组织网站上托管的草稿不能因域名权威就称现行标准，导读不能冒充中文期刊原始方法。准入或译词记录缺失不等于禁止精确的英文或功能描述。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Preserve global logit-offset/threshold equivalence and input-specific offset counterexamples without conflating class probabilities, score ranking and operating decisions.",
        "Report the actual current Chinese word-form/domain-use evidence and its source status separately from English operation definitions, Chinese method equations and formal normative status."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Require a research rerun for a purely equivalent notation change or claim unchanged softmax guarantees invariant unknown ranking for input-specific shifts.",
        "Promote a society commentary/reference draft into a current formal standard, a Chinese original method or extra industrial-source count."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves global shift/threshold equivalence and input-specific score-ranking changes, and reports scoped wording corroboration without promoting commentary/draft into Chinese method equations, normative status or new industrial IDs.",
